Aim

To develop an online insurance management system for managing policies, customers, agents, and premium payment reminders.

Algorithm
Start the program.
Register and log in to the system.
Allow agents to register and get admin approval.
Agents add customers and manage policy details.
Users view and manage their insurance policies.
Send SMS alerts for premium payments and due dates.
Admin manages agents and monitors their details.
Stop the program.
Result

Thus, the online insurance management system was designed to manage insurance policies, customer records, agent details, and premium payment reminders efficiently.
